  "title": "Separate the data bytes in IEEE 802.15.4 TAP DLT",
  "description": "Improve dissection of IEEE 802.15.4 TAP DLT by reporting the number of\ndata bytes of the original data frame and create a separate packet bytes\npane containing just that data without the TAP TLV content.\n\nThese changes enable the over the air data length to be applied as a column and copying only the OTA data bytes.",
