      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2722a126183709a8a174f1848dd21e858021687a",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 548776527,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Yes a more general solution would be nice.  I looked for a common solution to this problem but did not find one.  I'm open to other suggestions and criticism should this solution or the implementation of it be sub-par.\n\nI thought about adding an OTA DATA TLV to this linktype which reports the original OTA frame as separate item but that would unnecessarily hide the main content of interest one level down in the proto tree.",
